# mktodo Tasks

**Generated:** 2026-05-02  
**Project:** mktodo - Markdown TODO Management Tool  
**Status:** Ready for implementation

This document contains all actionable tasks extracted from the implementation plan, organized by phase and priority.

---

## Phase 0: Project Setup

### 0.1: Initialize Go Module
**Priority:** MUST  
**Estimated Effort:** 1 hour  
**Dependencies:** None

- [ ] Run `go mod init github.com/jvzantvoort/mktodo`
- [ ] Create directory structure (cmd, internal, messages, testdata)
- [ ] Create `main.go` with basic structure
- [ ] Initialize git repository (`git init`)
- [ ] Create `.gitignore` for Go projects

**Acceptance Criteria:**
- Module imports successfully
- Directory structure matches plan
- Git initialized with proper gitignore

---

### 0.2: Configure Development Tools
**Priority:** MUST  
**Estimated Effort:** 2 hours  
**Dependencies:** 0.1

- [ ] Create `.golangci.yml` configuration
  - Enable: govet, errcheck, staticcheck, gosimple, ineffassign, unused
  - Set gocyclo complexity limit: 10
  - Configure gofmt and goimports
- [ ] Create `Makefile` with targets:
  - `build` - Build binary
  - `test` - Run all tests
  - `lint` - Run golangci-lint
  - `coverage` - Generate coverage report
  - `clean` - Remove build artifacts
  - `install` - Install binary locally
  - `check` - Run test + lint
- [ ] Add development setup to README.md

**Acceptance Criteria:**
- `make lint` executes successfully
- `make test` runs (even with no tests yet)
- `make build` produces binary

---

### 0.3: Setup CI/CD Pipeline
**Priority:** MUST  
**Estimated Effort:** 3 hours  
**Dependencies:** 0.2

- [ ] Create `.github/workflows/ci.yml`
  - Trigger on push and pull_request
  - Matrix test: Linux, macOS, Windows
  - Run `make test`
  - Run `make lint`
  - Upload coverage to codecov/coveralls
- [ ] Create `.github/workflows/lint.yml`
  - Run golangci-lint
  - Check gofmt formatting
  - Fail on warnings
- [ ] Create `.github/workflows/release.yml`
  - Trigger on tag push (v*)
  - Build binaries for multiple platforms
  - Create GitHub release with binaries
  - Generate checksums

**Acceptance Criteria:**
- CI runs on every push
- All platforms tested
- Lint failures block PRs

---

### 0.4: Install Dependencies
**Priority:** MUST  
**Estimated Effort:** 30 minutes  
**Dependencies:** 0.1

- [ ] Install Cobra: `go get github.com/spf13/cobra@latest`
- [ ] Install Viper: `go get github.com/spf13/viper@latest`
- [ ] Install Bubbletea: `go get github.com/charmbracelet/bubbletea@latest`
- [ ] Run `go mod tidy`
- [ ] Verify `go build` succeeds

**Acceptance Criteria:**
- All dependencies in `go.mod`
- No version conflicts
- Build succeeds

---

